WEBVTT

00:07.738 --> 00:09.174
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.261 --> 00:10.695
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.782 --> 00:12.391
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.478 --> 00:14.217
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.304 --> 00:17.478
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.564 --> 00:19.478
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.564 --> 00:21.564
Kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.651 --> 00:23.391
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.478 --> 00:25.304
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.391 --> 00:27.269
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.304 --> 00:29.651
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.738 --> 00:31.584
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.608 --> 00:33.174
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.261 --> 00:34.956
All:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.043 --> 00:37.391
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.478 --> 00:39.217
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.304 --> 00:40.695
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.782 --> 00:42.521
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.608 --> 00:45.217
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.304 --> 00:47.521
[flute plays]
[长笛演奏]

00:47.608 --> 00:48.825
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:50.651 --> 00:53.521
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

00:53.608 --> 01:00.564
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:00.651 --> 01:02.304
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

01:02.391 --> 01:04.174
- [grunts] Yes!
- [咕哝]是的！

01:04.261 --> 01:08.130
My new Tootsie Trampler
is finally complete!
我的新 Tootsie Trampler
终于完成了！

01:08.217 --> 01:13.738
At last, I will be the stomper,
not the stompee.
最后，我将成为践踏者，
不是踩踏者。

01:13.825 --> 01:15.738
[laughs maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

01:15.825 --> 01:17.651
[stomping]
[跺脚]

01:17.738 --> 01:21.000
Ouch, Karen!
Help!
哎哟，凯伦！
帮助！

01:21.087 --> 01:24.043
- I think we have company.
- 我想我们有同伴。

01:24.130 --> 01:26.738
Oh, here.
Let's exfoliate you.
哦，在这里。
让我们给你去角质吧。

01:26.825 --> 01:28.435
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

01:28.521 --> 01:29.520
[melodic horn honks]
[旋律号角鸣响]

01:29.564 --> 01:30.869
- Who is that?
- 那是谁？

01:30.956 --> 01:33.434
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

01:33.521 --> 01:36.650
Holy moly macarooney.
圣莫里通心粉。

01:36.738 --> 01:39.912
Huh?
[grunts]
啊？
[咕哝]

01:45.217 --> 01:46.478
- Howdy, son!
- 你好，儿子！

01:46.563 --> 01:49.130
- Ma? Pa?
- 妈？爸？

01:49.217 --> 01:53.217
- Karen, is that a new monitor?
- 凯伦，那是新显示器吗？

01:53.304 --> 01:55.738
- Oh, you charmer.
[giggles]
-哦，你这个迷人的人。
[咯咯笑]

01:55.825 --> 01:58.564
- Knock it off, Romeo.
- 别闹了，罗密欧。

01:58.651 --> 02:01.782
- Huh?
- 啊？

02:01.869 --> 02:06.956
How could you afford
this ridiculous monstrosity?
你怎么能负担得起
这个可笑的怪物？

02:07.043 --> 02:08.608
- Your ma and me
won the lottery...
- 你妈妈和我
中了彩票...

02:08.695 --> 02:11.217
- [laughs]
- So we moved to the big city.
- [笑]
- 所以我们搬到了大城市。

02:11.304 --> 02:15.130
Just like our
too-fancy-for-pants son.
就像我们的
太花哨的儿子。

02:15.217 --> 02:18.521
- We got ourselves a butler.
- 我们给自己找了个管家。

02:18.608 --> 02:21.217
- Your spittoon, madam?
- 你的痰盂吗，女士？

02:22.564 --> 02:26.174
Very good.
非常好。

02:26.261 --> 02:28.043
- Want a tour of the vehicle?
- 想要参观车辆吗？

02:28.130 --> 02:31.564
- Not really.
- Come on in!
- 并不真地。
- 进来吧！

02:31.651 --> 02:34.695
- Oh, real classy.
- 哦，真优雅。

02:34.782 --> 02:37.087
- Purty fancy, ain't it?
- 很花哨，不是吗？

02:37.174 --> 02:38.738
- That depends
on your definition
- 这取决于
根据你的定义

02:38.825 --> 02:41.825
of pretty and fancy.
[screams]
漂亮又花哨。
[尖叫声]

02:41.912 --> 02:46.391
- Our new homestead on wheels
has all the creature comforts.
- 我们带轮子的新家园
拥有一切物质享受。

02:46.478 --> 02:50.174
- Like this velvet
feeding trough for Elmer.
- 就像这个天鹅绒
埃尔默的喂食槽。

02:50.260 --> 02:54.608
Now, he can wallow
in luxury instead of filth.
现在，他可以沉溺其中
奢华而不是肮脏。

02:54.695 --> 02:58.650
- No, Elmer!
Put me down! Ow!
- 不，埃尔默！
放我下来！噢！

02:58.738 --> 03:04.087
- And a side-by-side outhouse
for them romantical evenings.
- 并排的户外厕所
为他们打造浪漫的夜晚。

03:04.174 --> 03:06.478
Mwah!
[flushes]
哇！
[脸红]

03:06.564 --> 03:10.738
- Plus, there's room
for the whole Plankton clan.
- 另外，还有空间
对于整个浮游生物家族。

03:10.825 --> 03:12.738
ALL: Howdy!
全体：你好！

03:12.825 --> 03:14.956
[friendly chatter]
[友好的闲聊]

03:15.043 --> 03:17.912
- Ugh, hello.
- 呃，你好。

03:18.000 --> 03:20.261
So how long
are you visiting for?
那么多久
你来访是为了？

03:20.348 --> 03:23.000
Seven, five,
maybe three minutes?
七、五、
也许三分钟？

03:23.087 --> 03:25.087
- We're here to stay, son.
- 我们会留下来，儿子。

03:25.174 --> 03:27.782
We're following
your lead and starting up
我们正在关注
你的领导和启动

03:27.869 --> 03:30.564
our own restaurant.
我们自己的餐厅。

03:30.651 --> 03:33.564
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

03:33.651 --> 03:35.391
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:35.477 --> 03:37.521
- The Spud Bucket!
- 马铃薯桶！

03:37.608 --> 03:39.478
[upbeat bluegrass music]
[欢快的蓝草音乐]

03:39.564 --> 03:40.825
- What in the wha?
- 哇什么？

03:40.912 --> 03:43.608
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:43.694 --> 03:45.130
- Guess what's on the menu.
- 猜猜菜单上有什么。

03:45.217 --> 03:48.478
- Let me guess, potatoes?
- 让我猜猜，土豆？

03:48.564 --> 03:51.608
- Oh, you done peeked.
We got tater sandwiches.
- 哦，你偷看了。
我们得到了土豆泥三明治。

03:51.695 --> 03:54.304
- Spud cakes.
- 马铃薯蛋糕。

03:54.391 --> 03:56.435
- Our fresh squeezed
tater juice.
- 我们的鲜榨
马铃薯汁。

03:56.521 --> 03:58.695
[cow moos]
[牛哞哞]

03:58.782 --> 04:01.217
- Ugh.
Ah!
- 呃。
啊!

04:01.304 --> 04:03.738
- Just for the kids,
tater balloons.
- 只为了孩子们，
塔特气球。

04:03.825 --> 04:06.043
[together]
Ow!
[一起]
噢！

04:06.130 --> 04:09.956
And the coup de grace,
Spud Surprise.
还有致命一击，
马铃薯惊喜。

04:10.043 --> 04:13.869
Oh, Cousin Cletus!
- Yep!
哦，克莱图斯表弟！
- 是的！

04:13.956 --> 04:17.564
Did somebody say surprise?
有人说惊讶吗？

04:17.651 --> 04:22.348
Yahoo!
- So much for my new monitor.
雅虎！
- 我的新显示器就这么多了。

04:22.435 --> 04:25.521
- Yeah, that's fine.
It's also stupid.
- 是的，没关系。
这也是愚蠢的。

04:25.608 --> 04:27.348
No one's going to eat
at a restaurant
没有人会去吃饭
在一家餐馆

04:27.435 --> 04:30.130
that only serves potatoes.
只供应土豆。

04:30.217 --> 04:32.564
- Oh, boy!
- Potatoes!
- 哦，孩子！
- 土豆！

04:32.651 --> 04:34.260
- Hey, everybody,
- 嘿，大家，

04:34.348 --> 04:36.695
this place sells
nothing but potatoes!
这个地方卖
除了土豆什么都没有！

04:36.781 --> 04:40.478
- Potato?
Ooh!
- 土豆？
哦！

04:40.564 --> 04:45.087
Hey, there's a new potato
restaurant across the street!
嘿，新土豆来了
街对面的餐厅！

04:45.174 --> 04:48.695
- I never say no
to a starchy tuber.
- 我从不说不
到淀粉块茎。

04:48.782 --> 04:51.391
Bleh.
[giggles]
布莱赫。
[咯咯笑]

04:51.478 --> 04:53.956
- Oh, boy!
[indistinct chatter]
- 哦，孩子！
[模糊的喋喋不休]

04:54.043 --> 04:56.000
- Run to the potatoes, Sir!
- 跑到土豆那里去，先生！

04:56.087 --> 04:57.912
- I'm going to need this
for spuds!
- 我需要这个
为了马铃薯！

04:58.000 --> 05:00.869
- [gasps]
Where's everybody going?
- [喘气]
大家都去哪儿了？

05:00.956 --> 05:03.087
- One of everything, please.
- 一切都请来一份。

05:03.174 --> 05:05.478
- A bunch of potatoes,
with extra peel.
- 一堆土豆，
有额外的果皮。

05:05.564 --> 05:08.825
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

05:08.912 --> 05:11.304
Karen?
- Yes, dear?
凯伦？
- 是的亲爱的？

05:11.391 --> 05:14.782
- People are idiots.
- Yes, dear.
- 人们都是白痴。
- 是的亲爱的。

05:14.869 --> 05:16.782
- Wait, Larry!
- 等等，拉里！

05:16.869 --> 05:20.521
Wouldn't you like a nice,
protein-packed Krabby Patty?
难道你不想有一个美好的，
富含蛋白质的蟹肉饼？

05:20.608 --> 05:24.217
- Yeah, sorry, bro,
but Larry needs to carbo load.
- 是的，对不起，兄弟，
但拉里需要补充碳水化合物。

05:24.304 --> 05:27.174
Weirdo.
- Oh.
怪人。
- 哦。

05:27.261 --> 05:30.695
That was me last customer.
- Hmm.
那是我最后一个顾客。
- 唔。

05:30.782 --> 05:34.608
Maybe I can work this
to my advantage.
也许我可以做这个
对我有利。

05:34.695 --> 05:36.651
- Oh, me restaurant.
- 哦，我的餐厅。

05:36.738 --> 05:38.738
[sobs]
[抽泣]

05:38.825 --> 05:40.521
- [hums melody]
- [哼唱旋律]

05:40.608 --> 05:43.478
- Order up.
- 订购。

05:43.564 --> 05:46.391
Order up.
订购吧。

05:46.478 --> 05:50.174
- Aw, business
a little slow today, Krabs?
- 噢，生意
今天有点慢吗，蟹蟹？

05:50.261 --> 05:53.782
- That Spud Bucket has
siphoned off all me customers!
- 那个马铃薯桶有
吸走了我所有的顾客！

05:53.869 --> 05:57.825
- My family's new restaurant
has put you out of business.
- 我家的新餐厅
让你破产了。

05:57.912 --> 06:00.435
You may as well
just give me the formula.
你也可以
只要给我公式即可。

06:00.521 --> 06:02.956
You got no use for it now.
现在你已经没有用了。

06:03.043 --> 06:05.521
- [sighs] You're right.
- [叹气]你是对的。

06:05.608 --> 06:08.217
Boyo, come here.
博约，过来。

06:08.304 --> 06:10.695
[face beeping]
[脸嘟嘟]

06:10.782 --> 06:13.348
- Oh!
- 哦！

06:13.435 --> 06:15.521
- You win, Plankton.
- 你赢了，浮游生物。

06:15.608 --> 06:18.130
Since no one wants
Krabby Patties anymore,
既然没有人想要
不再是蟹肉饼了

06:18.217 --> 06:21.261
me formula is worthless.
我的公式毫无价值。

06:22.521 --> 06:24.087
- Yes!
- 是的！

06:24.174 --> 06:27.130
With this worthless formula,
I can take over the world!
有了这个毫无价值的公式，
我可以征服世界！

06:27.217 --> 06:28.564
- Does that make your plan
- 这符合你的计划吗

06:28.651 --> 06:31.087
for world domination
worthless, too?
为了统治世界
也一文不值？

06:31.174 --> 06:34.261
- Wait a minute.
[sighs]
- 等一下。
[叹气]

06:34.348 --> 06:37.564
Oh, no.
Karen, take me home.
哦，不。
凯伦，带我回家。

06:37.651 --> 06:40.261
- Oh, muffin.
- 哦，松饼。

06:40.348 --> 06:42.521
- [giggles] [cackles]
- [咯咯笑] [咯咯笑]

06:42.608 --> 06:45.738
- What's so funny, Mr. Krabs?
- Oh, nothing.
- 蟹老板，有什么好笑的？
- 哦，没什么。

06:45.825 --> 06:48.304
I just sent a series of events
in motion
我刚刚发送了一系列事件
在运动中

06:48.391 --> 06:52.738
that will soon solve
all our problems.
这很快就会解决
我们所有的问题。

06:52.825 --> 06:56.912
- How am I going to shut down
that stupid Spud Bucket?
- 我要如何关闭
那个愚蠢的马铃薯桶？

06:57.000 --> 06:59.043
- Why don't you call
the health inspector?
- 你为什么不打电话
卫生督察？

06:59.130 --> 07:00.825
He shuts us down every week.
他每周都会让我们关门。

07:00.912 --> 07:03.478
- Karen, you're a genius.
- 凯伦，你是个天才。

07:03.564 --> 07:07.130
And since I built you,
I'm a double genius.
自从我建造了你，
我是一个双重天才。

07:07.217 --> 07:08.825
[phone beeps]
[电话嘟嘟声]

07:08.912 --> 07:11.391
- Bikini Bottom
Health Department.
- 比基尼下装
卫生部门。

07:11.478 --> 07:13.738
- Just look at it.
- 看看它。

07:13.825 --> 07:17.348
This joint is completely
infested with vermin.
这个联合完全是
充满害虫。

07:17.435 --> 07:22.043
The vermins are even
preparing the food.
害虫甚至
准备食物。

07:22.130 --> 07:25.651
[all laughing and humming]
[大家大笑和哼唱]

07:25.738 --> 07:27.478
- Oh my.
- 天哪。

07:27.564 --> 07:31.043
This restaurant
doesn't deserve an A.
这家餐厅
不值得获得A。

07:31.130 --> 07:32.521
[cash register chiming]
[收银机提示音]

07:32.608 --> 07:36.217
It deserves a triple A plus!
它值得获得 3A 加分！

07:36.304 --> 07:38.956
- What?
- Whoo-hoo! Thank you.
- 什么？
- 呼呼！谢谢。

07:39.043 --> 07:41.043
That's right neighborly.
这就是邻里关系吧。

07:41.130 --> 07:44.261
- And thank you, sir,
for your generous donation
- 谢谢你，先生，
感谢您的慷慨捐赠

07:44.348 --> 07:47.478
to the Health Inspector
Benevolent Fund.
给卫生督察
慈善基金。

07:47.564 --> 07:50.563
- Always ready to help
the less fortunate.
- 随时准备提供帮助
较不幸运的人。

07:50.651 --> 07:51.650
- Eh.
- 呃。

07:51.695 --> 07:53.521
[upbeat country music]
[欢快的乡村音乐]

07:53.608 --> 07:54.607
Huh?
啊？

07:57.478 --> 08:00.869
So you want customers, eh?
所以你想要客户，是吗？

08:00.956 --> 08:05.043
I'll give you a customer.
我会给你一个客户。

08:05.130 --> 08:06.478
- Howdy, son.
- 你好，儿子。

08:06.564 --> 08:09.087
What you got there?
你在那里得到了什么？

08:09.174 --> 08:12.608
- I brought you a restaurant
warming present, Dad.
- 我给你带来了一家餐馆
温暖的礼物，爸爸。

08:12.695 --> 08:16.521
Behold, the Insatiable Bulk!
看哪，贪得无厌的大块头！

08:16.608 --> 08:18.912
Come on in.
It's all you can eat.
进来吧。
这就是你能吃的一切。

08:19.000 --> 08:20.738
- Oh, boy!
- 哦，孩子！

08:20.825 --> 08:23.130
I can eat this.
I can eat all of this!
我可以吃这个。
这些我都能吃！

08:23.217 --> 08:26.478
[munching]
I can eat this!
[咀嚼]
我可以吃这个！

08:26.564 --> 08:28.651
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

08:28.738 --> 08:31.564
I can eat... I...
aww.
我可以吃……我……
哇。

08:33.695 --> 08:34.912
[chomps]
[咀嚼]

08:35.000 --> 08:36.651
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

08:36.738 --> 08:38.261
- Hey!
- [screams]
- 嘿！
- [尖叫]

08:38.348 --> 08:39.956
- So long, Spud Bucket.
- 再见，马铃薯桶。

08:40.043 --> 08:42.000
- Whoo-hoo!
Yeehaw!
- 呼呼！
耶哈！

08:42.087 --> 08:43.737
- Huh?
- 啊？

08:43.825 --> 08:46.564
- Well, I just have
to thank you.
- 嗯，我刚刚
谢谢你。

08:46.651 --> 08:49.000
This Patrick feller
is the Jim dandiest
这位帕特里克·费勒
是最花花公子的吉姆

08:49.087 --> 08:51.782
tater masher I ever did see.
我见过的马铃薯捣碎器。

08:51.869 --> 08:53.782
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:55.956 --> 08:57.261
Ah.
啊。

08:57.348 --> 08:59.478
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

08:59.564 --> 09:03.000
- [groans] Barnacles!
- [呻吟]藤壶！

09:03.087 --> 09:05.651
Ow!
- [giggles]
噢！
- [咯咯笑]

09:05.738 --> 09:08.087
Things are going
even better than I hoped.
事情进展顺利
甚至比我希望的还要好。

09:08.174 --> 09:11.130
- I love when you get
all Machiavellian, Mr. Krabs.
- 我喜欢你得到的时候
蟹老板，都是马基雅维利主义者。

09:16.087 --> 09:18.825
- I got a load of potatoes
for the, uh, Spud Bucket.
- 我有一大堆土豆
对于，呃，马铃薯桶。

09:18.912 --> 09:20.261
- Hold on.
- 坚持，稍等。

09:20.348 --> 09:23.348
I've got a delivery, too.
我也有快递了

09:23.435 --> 09:25.000
Fire in the hole!
洞里着火了！

09:25.087 --> 09:26.869
[explosion]
[爆炸]

09:26.956 --> 09:29.825
Huh?
Ah.
啊？
啊。

09:29.912 --> 09:33.043
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:33.130 --> 09:35.261
- [chomps] Mm.
- [咀嚼] 嗯。

09:35.348 --> 09:39.478
This tater shrapnel
is better than Frenchy fries.
这块土豆弹片
比炸薯条更好。

09:39.564 --> 09:41.304
- Mm-hmm!
- 嗯嗯！

09:41.391 --> 09:44.304
- Your awful Spud Bucket
has ruined
- 你那可怕的土豆桶
已经毁了

09:44.391 --> 09:47.304
my plans to conquer the world.
我征服世界的计划。

09:47.391 --> 09:49.478
Now what am I supposed to do?
现在我该怎么办？

09:49.564 --> 09:52.043
- Well, why don't you
come work for us?
- 好吧，你为什么不呢？
来为我们工作吗？

09:52.130 --> 09:54.825
- The Spud Bucket
is a family business,
- 土豆桶
是一家家族企业，

09:54.912 --> 09:57.435
and you're family, son.
儿子，你们是家人。

09:57.521 --> 10:00.825
- Well, if I can't sabotage 'em,
- 好吧，如果我不能破坏他们，

10:00.912 --> 10:04.956
annihilate 'em, or squelch 'em,
I might as well join 'em.
消灭他们，或者镇压他们，
我不妨加入他们。

10:06.869 --> 10:09.782
[humming melody]
[哼唱的旋律]

10:09.869 --> 10:11.608
Ah, hey!
啊，嘿！

10:11.695 --> 10:13.695
One Spud du Jour.
一份土豆泥。

10:13.782 --> 10:15.825
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:15.912 --> 10:18.825
Yep, you know,
cooking food that people
是的，你知道，
烹饪人们的食物

10:18.912 --> 10:22.912
really want to eat actually
makes me pretty happy.
其实真的很想吃
让我很高兴。

10:23.000 --> 10:26.130
- Your tater, sir.
- Oh, boy!
- 你的土豆泥，先生。
- 哦，孩子！

10:26.217 --> 10:28.261
[chomps]
[咀嚼]

10:28.348 --> 10:30.738
Bleh!
哎呀！

10:30.825 --> 10:34.043
Eeeh!
哎呀！

10:34.130 --> 10:38.217
Excuse me, what is in
this peculiar potato?
打扰一下，里面有什么
这种奇特的土豆？

10:38.304 --> 10:40.912
- That's a Potato a la Plankton.
- 那是浮游生物土豆。

10:41.000 --> 10:43.348
With just a pinch of chum
for flavor.
只需一点密友
为了味道。

10:43.435 --> 10:46.000
- Oh, no.
You're the chef?
- 哦，不。
你是厨师吗？

10:46.087 --> 10:48.869
Everyone,
put down your potatoes.
大家，
放下你的土豆。

10:48.956 --> 10:52.348
Plankton is in the kitchen!
浮游生物在厨房里！

10:52.435 --> 10:54.217
- [gags]
- [gags]
- [笑声]
- [笑声]

10:54.304 --> 10:55.869
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

10:55.956 --> 10:57.348
[all spit]
[全吐]

10:57.435 --> 11:00.391
[screaming]
[尖叫]

11:03.087 --> 11:04.869
- [sighs]
- I don't get it.
- [叹气]
- 我不明白。

11:04.956 --> 11:06.738
What happened?
发生了什么？

11:06.825 --> 11:09.956
- Guess our tater restaurant
is a big fat failure.
- 猜猜我们的土豆泥餐厅
是一个巨大的脂肪失败。

11:10.043 --> 11:13.869
- Ah, well.
You win some and you lose some.
- 啊，好吧。
你赢得了一些，也失去了一些。

11:13.956 --> 11:15.564
Cousin Cletus!
克莱图斯表弟！

11:15.651 --> 11:19.738
Another surprise, please.
- [giggles]
再来一个惊喜，拜托。
- [咯咯笑]

11:19.825 --> 11:22.738
[melodic horn honking]
[旋律喇叭鸣响]

11:22.825 --> 11:25.130
- So long, son!
- 再见，儿子！

11:25.217 --> 11:27.391
- We're off to buy
a football team.
- 我们去买
一支足球队。

11:27.478 --> 11:30.217
[honks]
[喇叭]

11:30.304 --> 11:32.087
- [cackles]
- [咯咯笑]

11:32.174 --> 11:35.391
Turns out me formula's
worth something after all.
结果我的公式
毕竟值得一些东西。

11:35.478 --> 11:39.738
Who's the loser now, Plankton?
Surprise!
浮游生物，现在谁是输家？
惊喜！

11:39.825 --> 11:43.130
- Did somebody say surprise?
Yah!
- 有人说惊讶吗？
啊！

11:44.912 --> 11:46.825
- [together] Surprise.
- [一起] 惊喜。

11:46.912 --> 11:48.564
[both groan]
[两人都呻吟]

11:50.564 --> 11:53.435
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

11:53.521 --> 11:59.738
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:59.825 --> 12:01.956
- I love going to the movies.
- 我喜欢去看电影。

12:02.043 --> 12:04.695
The sticky floors
make me feel grounded.
粘乎乎的地板
让我感到踏实。

12:04.782 --> 12:07.912
- I can't wait for you
to see this movie, SpongeBob.
- 我等不及你了
看这部电影，海绵宝宝。

12:08.000 --> 12:12.521
It's the funniest thing
I've never seen in your life.
这是最好笑的事
我一生中从未见过。

12:12.608 --> 12:15.564
There's this one part
where this guy...
有这么一段
这家伙哪里...

12:15.651 --> 12:17.564
[laughs]
- Two combos, please.
[笑]
- 请给我两个组合。

12:17.651 --> 12:21.217
- Is wearing a hat.
[laughing]
- 戴着帽子。
[笑]

12:21.304 --> 12:23.043
- No spoilers, Patrick.
- 没有剧透，帕特里克。

12:23.130 --> 12:25.956
[soaring orchestral music]
【高亢的管弦乐】

12:26.043 --> 12:29.478
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:29.564 --> 12:31.217
"Prudence in Love"?
“爱情中的谨慎”？

12:31.304 --> 12:33.261
That doesn't sound funny.
这听起来并不好笑。

12:33.348 --> 12:36.174
Patrick, are you sure
we're in the right theater?
帕特里克，你确定吗
我们在正确的剧院吗？

12:36.261 --> 12:38.869
- [laughs] Shh!
- [笑]嘘！

12:38.956 --> 12:40.695
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:40.782 --> 12:44.435
- I love you, Prudence.
- And I you, Nathaniel.
- 我爱你，普鲁登丝。
- 我和你，纳撒尼尔。

12:44.521 --> 12:46.695
- But I love you more, Prudence.
- 但我更爱你，普鲁登丝。

12:46.782 --> 12:50.000
- Then I love you slightly more
than that, Nathaniel.
- 那我爱你多一点
不仅如此，纳撒尼尔。

12:50.087 --> 12:52.912
- It's not
a competition, Prudence.
- 不是
一场比赛，普鲁登斯。

12:53.000 --> 12:55.348
- But if it were,
I'd be winning.
- 但如果是这样的话
我会赢的。

12:55.435 --> 12:57.217
- Aw, this is so sweet.
- 噢，这太甜了。

12:57.304 --> 12:58.608
[whispers]
But it's not funny.
[窃窃私语]
但这并不好笑。

12:58.695 --> 13:01.087
- [laughs]
- [笑]

13:01.174 --> 13:04.564
- But your laughter
is so infectious.
- 但你的笑声
太有感染力了。

13:04.651 --> 13:07.521
[laughter]
[笑声]

13:12.478 --> 13:14.912
- And just then, all the years
- 就在那时，所有这些年

13:15.000 --> 13:18.217
of excessive laughing
finally took their toll,
过度大笑的
终于付出了代价，

13:18.304 --> 13:22.174
and SpongeBob's funny bone
got stuck in high gear.
和海绵宝宝的有趣骨头
陷入高速档。

13:22.261 --> 13:25.174
[laughter]
[笑声]

13:28.435 --> 13:30.912
- It's not
that funny, SpongeBob.
- 不是
真有趣，海绵宝宝。

13:31.000 --> 13:32.782
- [continues laughing]
- [继续笑]

13:32.869 --> 13:34.608
- Hey, what are you laughing at?
- 嘿，你笑什么？

13:34.695 --> 13:36.869
This is a melodrama,
not a comedy.
这是一部情节剧，
不是喜剧。

13:36.956 --> 13:39.564
- Yes!
Take a hike, Chuckles.
- 是的！
去远足吧，咯咯。

13:39.651 --> 13:42.435
[audience booing]
[观众嘘声]

13:42.521 --> 13:44.738
- Can you believe this guy,
- 你能相信这个人吗

13:44.825 --> 13:47.695
laughing all through
the movie like that?
自始至终都在笑
电影是这样的吗？

13:47.782 --> 13:50.130
- Who is making all that noise?
- 是谁发出这么大的噪音？

13:50.217 --> 13:52.304
- [laughing]
- [笑]

13:52.391 --> 13:54.564
- All right, laughing boy,
- 好吧，爱笑的男孩，

13:54.651 --> 13:57.348
take your hardy har hars
outside!
带上你坚强的哈哈斯
外面！

13:57.435 --> 13:59.564
[audience cheering]
[观众欢呼]

13:59.651 --> 14:02.521
- Oh!
- 哦！

14:02.608 --> 14:06.348
[laughs]
Huh? Uh-oh.
[笑]
啊？呃哦。

14:06.435 --> 14:10.261
Why can't...
why can't I stop laughing?
为什么不能...
为什么我无法停止笑？

14:10.348 --> 14:12.478
[laughs]
[笑]

14:12.564 --> 14:14.869
Oh, what am I going to do?
[giggles]
哦，我该怎么办？
[咯咯笑]

14:14.956 --> 14:17.912
I'll just have to...
hold it in.
我只需要...
坚持住。

14:18.000 --> 14:20.738
[snickers]
[窃笑]

14:20.825 --> 14:23.869
[grunts]
[咕哝]

14:23.956 --> 14:26.782
[muffled chuckling]
[低声笑]

14:30.087 --> 14:32.000
I know.
I'll just hold my breath.
我知道。
我会屏住呼吸。

14:32.087 --> 14:33.391
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

14:39.912 --> 14:41.738
- No doubt about it, sir.
- 毫无疑问，先生。

14:41.825 --> 14:45.391
You look fantastic in that hat.
你戴那顶帽子看起来棒极了。

14:45.478 --> 14:48.000
- [laughs]
- [笑]

14:48.087 --> 14:51.738
- Oh, I look fantastic, huh?
- Oh, wait.
- 哦，我看起来棒极了，是吧？
- 哦，等等。

14:51.825 --> 14:53.000
I'm not laughing at you.
我不是在笑你。

14:53.087 --> 14:55.825
I really like that hat.
[laughing]
我真的很喜欢那顶帽子。
[笑]

15:00.825 --> 15:04.391
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

15:04.478 --> 15:07.000
- You're crying
over spilled milk!
- 你在哭
牛奶洒了！

15:07.087 --> 15:12.391
[laughs]
Sorry! Sorry. Sorry.
[笑]
抱歉！对不起。对不起。

15:12.478 --> 15:15.261
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

15:15.348 --> 15:18.000
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

15:24.174 --> 15:27.000
OK, if I can just make it
to the kitchen,
好吧，如果我能做到的话
到厨房，

15:27.087 --> 15:29.564
nobody will hear me laughing.
没有人会听到我笑。

15:29.651 --> 15:31.782
[chuckles]
[笑声]

15:34.000 --> 15:36.869
- SpongeBob,
kindly get in the kitchen.
- 海绵宝宝，
请进厨房。

15:36.956 --> 15:40.564
And off of my face!
- Your face?
然后从我脸上消失！
- 你的脸？

15:40.651 --> 15:42.695
[laughs]
[笑]

15:42.782 --> 15:45.000
- What's so funny about my face?
- 我的脸有什么好笑的？

15:45.087 --> 15:47.651
- Well, there's nothing
funny about your...
- 嗯，没什么
有趣的是你的...

15:47.738 --> 15:50.651
face.
[laughs]
脸。
[笑]

15:52.348 --> 15:54.130
- Don't laugh at me.
- 别笑我。

15:54.217 --> 15:57.043
I laugh at you.
Ha!
我笑你。
哈!

15:58.695 --> 16:01.651
Don't listen to him.
You're beautiful.
别听他的。
你非常美。

16:01.738 --> 16:03.391
Mwah.
哇。

16:03.478 --> 16:06.304
- Nobody will hear
my laughs in here.
- 没有人会听到
我的笑声就在这里。

16:06.391 --> 16:10.695
[groans]
[laughs]
[呻吟]
[笑]

16:10.782 --> 16:12.348
- Hey, I'm eating here!
- 嘿，我在这里吃饭！

16:12.435 --> 16:15.956
- Why is the restaurant
laughing at us?
- 为什么是餐厅
嘲笑我们？

16:16.043 --> 16:18.435
- [laughs]
- Huh?
- [笑]
- 啊？

16:18.521 --> 16:20.043
[growls]
[咆哮]

16:20.130 --> 16:22.391
- [laughing]
- SpongeBob!
- [笑]
- 海绵宝宝！

16:22.478 --> 16:24.087
- [laughing]
- [笑]

16:24.174 --> 16:25.738
- Your little laughing prank
- 你的小恶作剧

16:25.825 --> 16:27.608
just scared away
all the customers.
刚刚被吓跑了
所有的顾客。

16:27.695 --> 16:29.521
Explain yourself, boyo!
解释一下你自己，男孩！

16:29.608 --> 16:31.825
- He's laughing
at my face, Mr. Krabs.
- 他在笑
就在我面前，蟹老板。

16:31.912 --> 16:34.261
- Oh, I'm not laughing at you,
Squidward.
-哦，我不是在笑你，
章鱼哥。

16:34.348 --> 16:37.651
[stifled laughter]
I'm not laughing at anything.
[抑制笑声]
我没有笑任何事。

16:37.738 --> 16:43.130
[laughs]
Mr. Krabs, what do I do?
[笑]
蟹老板，我该怎么办？

16:43.217 --> 16:46.087
- Think of happy thoughts
and just knock it off!
- 想想快乐的想法
然后把它关掉！

16:46.174 --> 16:48.348
- I am offended!
- 我很生气！

16:48.435 --> 16:52.000
There is no one here
to take my Fifi's order!
这里没有人
接受我菲菲的订单！

16:52.087 --> 16:54.912
- Oh, gold-plated sorries,
Lady Upturn.
- 哦，镀金抱歉，
女士逆袭。

16:55.000 --> 16:56.217
Mr. Squidward will take
章鱼哥先生将采取

16:56.304 --> 16:58.174
your very important order
right away.
您非常重要的订单
马上。

16:58.261 --> 17:02.087
- Whoa!
I need an ambulance.
- 哇！
我需要一辆救护车。

17:02.174 --> 17:03.348
- [laughs]
- [笑]

17:03.435 --> 17:06.738
- How dare you laugh
at my misfortune!
- 你怎么敢笑
我的不幸！

17:06.825 --> 17:10.478
Mr. Krabs,
fire this cretin at once!
蟹老板先生，
立刻开火这个白痴！

17:10.564 --> 17:11.782
- You heard her.
- 你听到她的声音了。

17:11.869 --> 17:15.217
Come back when you're not
a giggling idiot.
当你不在的时候回来吧
一个傻笑的白痴。

17:15.304 --> 17:17.174
- Don't come back?
- 不回来吗？

17:17.261 --> 17:21.825
But, Mr. Krabs,
I'm not laughing on purpose.
但是，蟹老板，
我不是故意笑的

17:21.912 --> 17:24.824
[laughs]
- [gasps]
[笑]
- [喘气]

17:24.912 --> 17:27.391
He's laughing at you, Fifi
他在笑你，菲菲

17:27.478 --> 17:29.130
- [laughing]
- [笑]

17:29.217 --> 17:30.956
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

17:31.043 --> 17:33.825
[snarling and chomping]
[咆哮和咀嚼]

17:35.912 --> 17:38.564
- I'm sorry, Fifi.
- 对不起，菲菲。

17:38.651 --> 17:41.391
I'm a monster!
我是一个怪物！

17:41.478 --> 17:44.435
[laughing]
[笑]

17:44.521 --> 17:47.391
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

17:47.478 --> 17:53.564
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:53.651 --> 17:55.348
I got to hide.
我得躲起来。

17:55.435 --> 17:57.825
That way, my laughter
won't hurt anyone else.
这样我的笑声
不会伤害其他人。

17:57.912 --> 18:01.521
[laughs]
OK, good.
[笑]
好的，很好。

18:01.608 --> 18:03.521
It's dark.
天黑了。

18:03.608 --> 18:05.540
If there's nothing to see,
there's nothing to laugh at.
如果没什么可看的
没有什么好笑的。

18:05.564 --> 18:06.563
Right?
正确的？

18:06.608 --> 18:09.782
[snickering]
[窃笑]

18:11.564 --> 18:15.304
- Today, we will be
operating on a robot.
- 今天，我们将
在机器人上操作。

18:15.391 --> 18:17.869
- Oh, robot.
- How exciting.
- 哦，机器人。
- 多么令人兴奋啊。

18:17.956 --> 18:19.348
- What will they think of next?
- 接下来他们会想到什么？

18:19.435 --> 18:22.564
- I will begin
by loosening the first bolt.
- 我会开始
松开第一个螺栓。

18:22.651 --> 18:26.130
Nurse, wrench.
护士，扳手。

18:26.217 --> 18:29.000
[grunts]
[咕哝]

18:29.087 --> 18:31.869
Wow.
This is really on tight.
哇。
这实在是太紧了。

18:31.956 --> 18:33.738
Nurse, sponge.
护士，海绵。

18:33.825 --> 18:36.130
- Ooh.
[laughs]
- 哦。
[笑]

18:36.217 --> 18:38.564
- Laughing is not allowed
in the operating room.
- 不允许笑
在手术室里。

18:38.651 --> 18:40.478
Get out of here!
离开这里！

18:40.564 --> 18:42.825
[electricity crackles]
[电流爆裂声]

18:42.912 --> 18:45.304
[tense music]
[紧张的音乐]

18:45.391 --> 18:48.521
- [laughs] I am the surgeon now.
- [笑]我现在是外科医生。

18:48.608 --> 18:50.825
I am the surgeon now.
I am the surgeon now.
我现在是外科医生。
我现在是外科医生。

18:50.912 --> 18:52.869
- Ooh.
- Ah.
- 哦。
- 啊。

18:52.956 --> 18:54.521
- Ooh.
- Fascinating.
- 哦。
- 迷人。

18:54.608 --> 18:55.521
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

18:55.608 --> 18:58.391
- [laughing]
- [grumbles]
- [笑]
- [抱怨]

18:58.478 --> 19:00.348
- That is not funny.
- 这不好笑。

19:00.435 --> 19:03.000
[laughing]
[笑]

19:03.087 --> 19:05.782
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

19:05.869 --> 19:08.391
The cemetery.
墓地。

19:08.478 --> 19:10.564
There's nothing funny
in a cemetery.
没有什么好笑的
在一个墓地里。

19:10.651 --> 19:12.435
[snickering]
[窃笑]

19:12.521 --> 19:14.825
Maybe I'll just live
the rest of my life here.
也许我就这样活着
我的余生都在这里。

19:14.912 --> 19:17.651
[somber music]
[忧郁的音乐]

19:17.738 --> 19:20.651
[muffled laughter]
[低沉的笑声]

19:20.738 --> 19:23.043
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

19:23.130 --> 19:24.956
- [sobbing]
- [gasps]
- [抽泣]
- [喘气]

19:25.043 --> 19:27.738
Clowns?
Oh, no.
小丑？
哦，不。

19:27.825 --> 19:31.435
- There are two kinds of clowns
in this world,
- 小丑有两种
在这个世界上，

19:31.521 --> 19:34.564
clowns that are only laughing
on the outside,
只会笑的小丑
在外面，

19:34.651 --> 19:39.261
and clowns that are
only laughing on the inside.
和小丑
只是内心在笑。

19:39.348 --> 19:42.956
Sparkle Nose the Clown was both,
闪闪鼻子的小丑两者兼而有之，

19:43.043 --> 19:45.912
and that's what made him a star.
这就是他成为明星的原因。

19:46.000 --> 19:47.825
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

19:47.912 --> 19:50.130
[horns honking]
[喇叭鸣响]

19:50.217 --> 19:54.651
- So solemn.
I should leave.
- 如此庄严。
我该离开了。

19:54.738 --> 19:55.782
Whoa!
[horn honks]
哇！
[喇叭鸣响]

19:55.869 --> 20:01.304
Hey!
[laughs]
嘿！
[笑]

20:01.391 --> 20:03.956
Holy herring,
I'm squatting on a corpse.
圣鲱鱼，
我蹲在一具尸体上。

20:04.043 --> 20:07.217
- Would you get off my chest?
- 你能离开我的胸口吗？

20:07.304 --> 20:12.174
- [laughs]
Huh? You're alive?
- [笑]
啊？你还活着吗？

20:12.261 --> 20:14.608
- Of course, I'm alive.
- 当然，我还活着。

20:14.695 --> 20:17.782
This is a living funeral,
and you're ruining it.
这是一场活生生的葬礼
而你正在毁掉它。

20:17.869 --> 20:20.043
- Sorry.
- 对不起。

20:20.130 --> 20:22.956
I'm not laughing at you,
Sparkle Nose.
我不是在笑你
闪闪发光的鼻子。

20:23.043 --> 20:26.608
Oh, I'll just
get off of your chest.
哦，我就
从你的胸口下来。

20:26.695 --> 20:28.956
Whoa!
哇！

20:29.043 --> 20:30.869
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

20:30.956 --> 20:33.695
- I'm allergic to wreath pollen!
- 我对花环花粉过敏！

20:33.782 --> 20:36.087
Eeh, ah...
诶诶诶……

20:36.174 --> 20:38.521
- Cheese it, he's going to blow!
- 干酪吧，他要爆炸了！

20:38.608 --> 20:41.087
- Achoo!
- 阿呼！

20:43.738 --> 20:46.695
- Sorry.
[laughs]
- 对不起。
[笑]

20:46.782 --> 20:50.825
- You turned my clown funeral
into a joke!
- You turned my clown funeral
变成笑话了！

20:50.912 --> 20:54.130
[honking]
[鸣喇叭]

20:54.217 --> 20:57.651
- [laughs]
Forgive me, Sparkle Nose!
- [笑]
原谅我，闪闪的鼻子！

20:57.738 --> 21:01.304
[laughs]
[笑]

21:01.391 --> 21:04.087
- Hours later, poor SpongeBob
- 几个小时后，可怜的海绵宝宝

21:04.174 --> 21:06.478
still could not stop laughing.
还是忍不住笑了。

21:06.564 --> 21:09.478
And his laughing mouth
got so big,
还有他那张笑起来的嘴
变得这么大了，

21:09.564 --> 21:13.869
it took over his whole face.
它占据了他的整张脸。

21:13.956 --> 21:16.912
- Oh, I'm tired of all this
cackling and chuckling.
- 哦，我厌倦了这一切
咯咯笑。

21:17.000 --> 21:20.087
I feel more like I want to...
我感觉我更想...

21:20.174 --> 21:23.608
Oh, "Weep"?
"The saddest movie ever."
噢，“哭泣”？
“有史以来最悲伤的电影。”

21:23.695 --> 21:26.000
That's it!
就是这样！

21:26.087 --> 21:31.043
A movie started my laughing.
Maybe a movie can stop it.
一部电影让我笑了。
也许一部电影可以阻止它。

21:31.130 --> 21:34.695
- [sobbing]
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]
- [抽泣]

21:34.782 --> 21:37.651
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

21:37.738 --> 21:38.521
- [snickering]
- [窃笑]

21:38.608 --> 21:40.912
[laughs]
[笑]

21:41.000 --> 21:43.217
- Shh!
- I'm sorry.
- 嘘！
- 对不起。

21:46.087 --> 21:49.261
[laughs]
I can't hold it!
[笑]
我快撑不住了！

21:52.869 --> 21:55.782
[laughing and slapping]
[大笑并拍手]

21:55.869 --> 21:58.912
- [laughs]
- Huh?
- [笑]
- 啊？

21:59.000 --> 22:02.956
- [laughing]
- Grandma?
- [笑]
- 奶奶？

22:03.043 --> 22:06.435
You can't stop laughing either?
- Of course not, dearie.
你也笑得停不下来吗？
- 当然不是，亲爱的。

22:06.521 --> 22:08.695
My funny bone
got stuck years ago
我的搞笑骨头
几年前就被困住了

22:08.782 --> 22:11.695
when I was your age.
- Your funny bone?
当我像你这个年纪的时候。
- 你有趣的骨头？

22:11.782 --> 22:13.261
- That's right.
- 这是正确的。

22:13.348 --> 22:15.564
It happens
to everyone in our family.
它发生了
给我们家里的每个人。

22:15.651 --> 22:18.348
Be proud of that laugh,
SpongeBob.
为那笑容感到骄傲
海绵宝宝。

22:18.435 --> 22:21.695
To be a SquarePants
is to laugh loud at life.
成为一个方裤
就是对生活大声笑。

22:21.782 --> 22:26.348
Enjoy a good laugh with me.
- Oh, thanks, Grandma.
和我一起开心地笑吧。
-哦，谢谢，奶奶。

22:26.435 --> 22:30.000
- These tearjerker movies
always crack me up.
- 这些催人泪下的电影
总是让我开心。

22:30.087 --> 22:33.000
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

22:33.087 --> 22:36.782
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

22:36.869 --> 22:39.087
I'm all out of popcorn.
我的爆米花已经吃完了。

22:39.174 --> 22:41.782
Now it's a tragedy.
现在这是一场悲剧。

22:41.869 --> 22:43.043
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

[抽泣]